      "plan": "The plan is to create a hypothetical VRAM allocation checklist for a 12GB GPU, separating model weights, KV cache, and other runtime needs. It will explicitly state the hypothetical nature of the experiment and avoid any measured results or external facts. The content will be technical and suitable for r/LocalLLaMA readers, aiming to spark discussion on theoretical VRAM management."
